 "snapforge": {
  "tag_name": "v0.1.2",
  "name": "SnapForge 0.1.2",
  "published_at": "2026-11-15T11:54:12Z",
  "html_url": "https://github.com/zheerkhalid/snapforge/releases/tag/v0.1.2",
  "body": "**Easier tool sizing in the image editor**\n\n- **See the size on the canvas**: pencil, highlighter, eraser and clone stamp show a ring at the pointer that is exactly as big as the stroke. Lines, arrows and shapes show a dot of the stroke width.\n- **Size slider** in the tool bar, next to the value field (which still accepts exact numbers).\n- **Quick resize**: `[` and `]`, or `Alt` + mouse wheel. A small label shows the new size.\n- The same controls resize a selected annotation, as a single undo step.\n\n![Brush size preview](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zheerkhalid/snapforge/main/docs/screenshots/editor-brush-size.png)",
