  "body": "- **HEVC (H.265) front and centre**: two one-click picks at the top of *Recommended*, \"HEVC / H.265: smaller file, same quality\" and the new \"HEVC / H.265: very small file\". HEVC uses your graphics card when it supports it (NVENC, AMF, Quick Sync).\n- **Installer**: `ReelForge-Setup.exe` adds Start Menu and desktop shortcuts and an uninstaller.\n- **Portable ZIP** alongside the bare EXE.\n\nRequires FFmpeg: `winget install Gyan.FFmpeg`, or put `ffmpeg.exe` and `ffprobe.exe` next to `ReelForge.exe`.",
