 "unforge": {
  "tag_name": "v1.0.0",
  "name": "UnForge 1.0.0",
  "published_at": "2026-11-15T12:22:03Z",
  "html_url": "https://github.com/zheerkhalid/unforge/releases/tag/v1.0.0",
  "body": "First release of **UnForge**, a modern uninstaller for Windows by [Zheer Khalid](https://zheer.dev).\n\n- Lists desktop programs and Microsoft Store apps, with search, filters and batch uninstall\n- Guided uninstall: runs the program's uninstaller, then scans for leftover files, registry entries, shortcuts, services and tasks\n- You review every leftover before deletion; only items marked Safe are pre-ticked\n- Registry backed up before removal, files go to the Recycle Bin by default\n- Forced uninstall, startup manager, broken-entry cleanup, history with registry restore, CSV/HTML export\n- Single portable EXE (4.6 MB)\n\n**Note:** this is a first release. The uninstall flow is covered by an automated end-to-end test on a fake program; try it on a program you don't mind removing first, and review *Likely* and *Unsure* items before ticking them.",
  "assets": [
